Package: apabayes
Title: Report Bayesian and Structural Equation Models in APA Style for
    apaquarto
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Gidon T.", "Frischkorn", , "gidon.frischkorn@psychologie.uzh.ch", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5055-9764"))
Description: Inline strings and tables in American Psychological
    Association style, seventh edition, for Bayesian regression models
    fitted with 'brms' and 'bmm', structural equation models fitted with
    'lavaan' and 'blavaan', posterior hypothesis tests, leave-one-out
    model comparisons, Bayes factor comparisons and posterior contrasts.
    Every number comes from the 'easystats' packages ('parameters',
    'bayestestR', 'performance', 'insight'); 'apabayes' selects, arranges
    and formats. Tables extend the 'apa7' package so that they render
    through 'apa_flextable()' in the 'apaquarto' Quarto extension to PDF,
    Word, HTML and Typst; inline objects follow the 'papaja' result shape.
